# A display name with words that are not ASCII, and words with characters
# that a name in a header can only have in quotes ("Dr.", "(Einkauf)"):
# those are encoded too, rather than quoted next to the encoded words.  In
# a name, only letters, digits and !*+-/ stand for themselves in an encoded
# word, as RFC 2047 has it.
mode=accept
tls=none
form=(From="Dr. Jürgen Müller-Lüdenscheidt (Einkauf) <j@example.com>"
      To=bob@example.net Subject=Hello Body=$'Hi\n' User=alice Password=secret)
